---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<BaseHead title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`} />
</head>

<body>
	<Header />

	<main class="about-page">
		<h1>About</h1>

		<div class="about-content">
			<div class="about-text">
				<p>
					I am a postdoctoral researcher in the Department of Astronomy at Yonsei University.
					I obtained my bachelor's and master's degrees from Yonsei University in South Korea,
					where I worked on various topics related to galaxy evolution with Professor Sukyoung K. Yi.
					In 2018, I moved to the University of Maryland, College Park, to study the formation of
					Population III stars with Professor Massimo Ricotti. After receiving my Ph.D. in May 2024,
					I returned to Yonsei University and I am currently collaborating with Professor Taysun Kimm
					and Professor Sukyoung K. Yi on various topics in galaxy formation.
				</p>

				<p>
					My research interests include the formation of metal-free and metal-poor stars and their
					impact on the formation of the first galaxies and dwarf galaxies. To study these, I utilize
					the hydrodynamics code RAMSES and conduct computer simulations. My work involves implementing
					various physical processes, including chemistry and radiative processes, performing simulations
					using a supercomputer, and physically interpreting the results.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="profile-photo">
				<img
					src="/images/about/JP.png"
					alt="Jongwon Park"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>

	<Footer />
</body>
</html>

<style>
	.about-page {
		max-width: 1000px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
	}

	.about-page h1 {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.about-content {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 250px;
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.about-text p {
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
	}

	.profile-photo img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.about-page {
			padding: 2rem 1rem;
		}

		.about-content {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.profile-photo {
			order: -1;
			max-width: 220px;
		}
	}
</style>
